* 2N5060 Sensitive-Gate SCR (Verified Fixed)
* Pinout: 1=Anode, 2=Gate, 3=Cathode
.subckt 2N5060 1 2 3
Q1 4 2 3 NPN_SCR
Q2 2 4 1 PNP_SCR
Rgk 2 3 10k
Rak 1 3 10Meg
Cak 1 3 10p
.model NPN_SCR NPN(Bf=50 Is=1e-13 Vaf=50 Rc=0.3 Cje=15p Cjc=10p)
.model PNP_SCR PNP(Bf=15 Is=1e-13 Vaf=50 Rc=0.3 Cje=15p Cjc=10p)
.ends 2N5060
